; Example usage of the `kit-xor` plugin. The exactly-one group on
; `(phrase …)` is satisfied by supplying exactly `:notes`; the
; at-most-one group on `(tag …)` is satisfied here by leaving both
; `:color` and `:shape` off, but the alternative would be to set
; exactly one.

(phrase :name verse :notes [C4 E4 G4])
(phrase :name chorus :events [tick tock])
(tag :name section)
(tag :name accent :color "red")
